    <Name>INT_2015_0630</Name>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0630","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>Towards how to hang a painting upside down on purpose</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0630","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2015-07-15</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2015_0630","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Tenzin Quispe talks about the long argument with the colour blue. The artist asked that the microphone face away from the painting, so as not to influence it.</Description>
